rt+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"3ad9bfc601b55c866affdc02e0ef33563d2f580275be37784e628a483290b5f0","event_uuid":"e9f0ea0e-7055-4a18-b7cd-8dd39b3ccdcb","position":{"commit_sha":"0d8dd6df9d55a7088e2426d41a315d12a39e531e","position":"1786744141101580067-e9f0ea0e-7055-4a18-b7cd-8dd39b3ccdcb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"986aa289b9906b93410bc0dea814b176e406f25bba111a548bef929693658697","event_uuid":"11bf2de3-57be-4e2f-b4c4-3b00f35b953b","position":{"commit_sha":"a1fd5c0ef2edae0e043ba53c19e4dcfb7929539d","position":"1786746043297614001-11bf2de3-57be-4e2f-b4c4-3b00f35b953b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"37ec09972b6b3365e54ed52fd7c3925064cffcd1667ad7489b7ad952d680c3a6","event_uuid":"e564ed94-bcde-4e20-a065-21f0cadb5e2d","position":{"commit_sha":"b57750037a4ebb6ed1a52c1f8a7d64668fce761c","position":"1786746071864670001-e564ed94-bcde-4e20-a065-21f0cadb5e2d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Confirmed RCA: GitHub re-evaluates job-level if conditions during workflow cancellation. Commit 6f4123678c introduced leading always() functions on all seven full-route predicates; those conditions remain true when a run is canceled, so superseded matrix and reusable jobs continue until natural completion. GitHub docs commit 81ade08c workflow-cancellation.md lines 18-22 states this mechanism. Live run pair 31834162663 to 31834896849 showed 1510 seconds of successor admission delay and 1785 runner-seconds consumed after replacement creation, while pre-change controls canceled in 25-104 seconds. This violates the same-change cancel-in-progress contract tracked by smoky-flare-slug. Phase 2 proof: the strengthened workflow-contract test was collected and observed RED at the missing !cancelled() assertion before the fix, GREEN after the held-out fixer replaced only the seven leading status functions, and RED again when one always() defect was seeded. YAML, actionlint over all workflows, lint, typecheck, 8 focused routing tests, and 67 broader workflow-policy tests pass.","timestamp":1786743916840839001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Merged evidence (2026-08-14): Gerrit change 1792 merged to main as 4cbaa19315 at 22:19:15Z after LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. Verify run 31843821793 passed; created 21:45:45Z, Verified job completed 22:18:56Z, overall run completed 22:18:57Z (33m12s overall / 33m11s to vote-job completion). macOS default=1,591s step / 1,588.59s pytest, integration=193s step / 191.56s pytest. Only individual test phase above 30s was tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py::test_server_binds_loopback_only setup=35.13s. Other operations above 30s: selected mutation shards gates=718s, signing=657s, reducer-processors=611s, validate=447s, next-batch=391s; Ubuntu defaults py3.13=657s, py3.12=424s, py3.11=413s; Ubuntu integrations=89/88/83s; optional-extras isolation=86s; complexity lock=56s; ticket-history mount=41s. All jobs passed. CI_RESULT: {\"run_id\":\"31843821793\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":1992,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}. The first genuine post-merge same-change replacement remains required for the live cancellation acceptance criterion; this ticket therefore remains in_progress.","timestamp":1786746043297614001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit change 1792 merged on main at 4cbaa19315 after both gates passed. Verified run 31843821793 completed successfully from 2026-08-14T21:45:45Z to 22:18:57Z (1,992s / 33m12s); macOS ran 31m36s and remained the execution critical path. CI_RESULT: {\"run_id\":\"31843821793\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":1992,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}. Keep this ticket open until the first organic same-change replacement demonstrates prompt cancellation of the superseded run; two pre-fix organic pairs already proved the old always() behavior let canceled jobs finish naturally.","timestamp":1786746071864670001}],"created_at":1786743270137182001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"1095bc96-efae-4b05-8fdf-93ae0fa0bcd9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"4f50-b1f2-78af-4326"},{"link_uuid":"e9f0ea0e-7055-4a18-b7cd-8dd39b3ccdcb","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"1439-36ec-b17a-48db"}],"description":"## Context\nGerrit Verify uses same-change concurrency with cancel-in-progress=true, but the docs-only routing change 6f4123678c added job-level always() predicates to seven full-route jobs. GitHub re-evaluates those predicates during cancellation; because they remain true, stale matrix/reusable jobs are not canceled. In run pair 31834162663 -> 31834896849, the predecessor consumed 1,785 runner-seconds after the replacement existed and delayed successor job creation by 1,510 seconds.\n\nThe existing docs-only contract must remain fail closed: a classifier failure still launches the full fallback route and remains a blocking result. A superseding-patchset cancellation is a different state and must not launch or preserve stale full-route work.\n\n## Plan\n- Add a focused workflow-contract regression that is RED on the current job predicates and separately proves both branches: cancellation makes every full-route job ineligible; classifier failure while not canceled keeps every full-route job eligible.\n- Replace only the cancellation status portion of the seven full-route predicates with a cancellation-aware status check, preserving the current clear-vote, ticket, classifier-result, and route conditions byte-for-byte otherwise.\n- Keep the vote/finalization job cancellation-aware behavior unchanged so a canceled run is still normalized and reported.\n- Run the focused workflow tests, actionlint/YAML policy gates, make lint, and make typecheck.\n- Land through Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1. Use the first genuine same-change replacement as live confirmation; do not manufacture extra runner usage solely for the experiment.\n- Back out with a Gerrit revert if classifier-failure fallback or route aggregation regresses.\n\n## Evidence and prior decisions\n- GitHub cancellation reference, github/docs commit 81ade08c, lines 18-22: a running job whose if remains true is not canceled; always() is the explicit example.\n- Home Assistant core 58a3fdb, Apache Airflow ef759de, and Grafana 9587636 combine cancellation concurrency with !cancelled() predicates for dependent/fan-in work.\n- brainy-accused-wrasse requires classifier-failure full fallback; this change preserves it.\n- smoky-flare-slug requires new patchsets to auto-cancel prior Verify runs.\n- frowsy-beggarly-mammoth changes canceled-run diagnostics and does not reject prompt stale-run cancellation.\n- No prior rejection of this remediation was found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each full-route job becomes ineligible when the workflow run is canceled.\n- [ ] Each full-route job remains eligible when the classifier fails and the run is not canceled.\n- [ ] Each full-route job remains eligible for a successful full classification.\n- [ ] A docs-only classification still skips all seven full-route jobs and runs the documentation lane.\n- [ ] The seven job sets, OS/Python matrix cells, commands, assertions, and coverage behavior are unchanged.\n- [ ] The vote job still runs and reports a canceled workflow.\n- [ ] The regression oracle is observed RED before the workflow edit and GREEN afterward.\n- [ ] A defect-seeded restoration of always() makes the oracle RED again.\n- [ ] Focused workflow tests, actionlint/YAML checks, make lint, and make typecheck pass.\n- [ ] Gerrit LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 are recorded before merge.\n- [ ] The merged SHA and timing are recorded.\n- [ ] Live evidence from the first genuine same-change replacement shows stale full-route jobs conclude canceled and the successor is admitted without waiting for natural matrix completion.\n- [ ] Runner savings are reported without claiming the live cancellation saving as successful-run average wall-clock improvement.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","reason":"Make full-route job conditions cancellation-aware while preserving classifier-failure fallback."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gerrit_docs_only.py","reason":"Add the RED/GREEN workflow contract for cancellation, classifier failure, full route, docs-only route, and unchanged vote behavior."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","1439-36ec-b17a-48db"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"fde4c112-cefe-4004-b54b-c19f2957a868","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["ci","performance","reliability"],"ticket_id":"7906-a464-b75f-4f65","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Cancel superseded Gerrit Verify full-route jobs promptly","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e1f0497a-a712-4dcf-affe-fd8c9686e09e","1095bc96-efae-4b05-8fdf-93ae0fa0bcd9","215b3f89-0c19-4969-9d76-9322b80a59ea","43c67160-15ed-4455-869c-43d1663755fa","fde4c112-cefe-4004-b54b-c19f2957a868","f3d7c42f-2cf8-4f16-9e57-b2d4bd090b77","c13d4510-a456-4ccd-8549-6ede15260678","e9f0ea0e-7055-4a18-b7cd-8dd39b3ccdcb","11bf2de3-57be-4e2f-b4c4-3b00f35b953b","e564ed94-bcde-4e20-a065-21f0cadb5e2d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786750684318136001,"uuid":"77c7b486-ce38-4102-aeda-dd0390dc1bce"}